<Box style={{width: 1280, height: 720, background: "#FAFAF7", padding: "28px 64px 24px", flexDirection: "column", fontFamily: "PingFang SC"}}><Box style={{height: 96, flexDirection: "column", justifyContent: "center"}}><Text style={{fontFamily: "SF Mono", fontSize: 14, color: "rgba(28,31,35,0.40)", letterSpacing: 1}}>第四幕 · 你写哪类程序</Text><Text style={{fontSize: 36, fontWeight: 600, color: "#1C1F23", lineHeight: 1.25, marginTop: 10}}>现成的 coding harness 已经够好</Text></Box><Box style={{height: 532, flexDirection: "row", gap: 24, alignItems: "stretch"}}><Box style={{flex: 1, flexDirection: "column", padding: 26, background: "rgba(28,31,35,0.035)", borderRadius: 8, justifyContent: "center"}}><Text style={{fontFamily: "SF Mono", fontSize: 20, color: "#0F6E56"}}>它已经替你做了</Text><Box style={{flexDirection: "column", marginTop: 14}}><Text style={{fontSize: 24, color: "#1C1F23", lineHeight: 1.95}}>· 沙箱</Text><Text style={{fontSize: 24, color: "#1C1F23", lineHeight: 1.95}}>· 审批</Text><Text style={{fontSize: 24, color: "#1C1F23", lineHeight: 1.95}}>· 事件流</Text><Text style={{fontSize: 24, color: "#1C1F23", lineHeight: 1.95}}>· 长程记忆</Text></Box></Box><Box style={{flex: 1, flexDirection: "column", padding: 30, background: "rgba(15,110,86,0.07)", borderRadius: 8, justifyContent: "center"}}><Text style={{fontSize: 36, fontWeight: 600, color: "#0F6E56", lineHeight: 1.35}}>这条路你们不用自己造。</Text><Text style={{fontSize: 21, color: "rgba(28,31,35,0.70)", lineHeight: 1.6, marginTop: 18}}>只要项目本身的配置不是太离谱，写传统程序这件事，问题不大。</Text></Box></Box><Box style={{height: 40, flexDirection: "row", justifyContent: "space-between", alignItems: "flex-end"}}><Text style={{fontFamily: "SF Mono", fontSize: 14, color: "rgba(28,31,35,0.35)"}}>AI CODING EVOLUTION</Text><Text style={{fontFamily: "SF Mono", fontSize: 14, color: "rgba(28,31,35,0.45)"}}>27 / 37</Text></Box></Box>
